 ## A note on scope
 
-This is a personal tool, not an accounting package. It does not do tax categories,
-receipts, shared budgets, or anything clever with recurring expenses. If you need
-those, you have outgrown tally. If you just want to know whether you spent too much
-on takeout last month, you are in the right place.
+This is a personal tool, not an accounting package. It does not do tax
+categories, receipts, shared budgets, or anything clever with recurring
+expenses. If you need those, you have outgrown tally. If you just want to know
+whether you spent too much on takeout last month, you are in the right place.
